.TH QUIPU-IMPORT-DELTA 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-import\-delta \- Verify a delta share against its parent share
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu import delta\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-\-destination\fR] [\fB\-\-query\-namespace\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIparent\-share\fR> <\fIdelta\-share\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Verify a delta share against its parent share
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-destination\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-query\-namespace\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIparent\-share\fR>

.TP
<\fIdelta\-share\fR>

